      ],
      "image": "assets/images/150114/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, place olive oil, onion, garlic, and lemon juice into a pan. Cook over medium heat for about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ldNh7FYL5tzH0h6sSA83xF7-UaU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/150114-cuban-style-yuca-mfs-step-3-73-3602b1adc62f46fd8505ba5b040289ff.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/150114/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
